---
source: crates/daemon/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Every keyboard shortcut in the TUI and the web app, from one definition

Usage: mxr keys [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

Commands:
  explain  What a key does, in each client; with --context, what it does there
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --client <CLIENT>    Only this client's keys [possible values: tui, web]
      --context <CONTEXT>  Only keys live in this place: a TUI context or web scope, such as todo
      --format <FORMAT>    [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help               Print help
